sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 用户
    participant UI as MainForm
    participant ADB as AdbClient
    participant Lua as Lua助手/游戏进程
    participant Domain as MapDump/PlayerStatus
    participant Planner as Planner
    participant Exec as RouteExecutor
    participant Watch as PopupWatchdog
    participant Trace as PipelineTrace/Web

    User->>UI: 扫描/连接/开始
    UI->>ADB: Devices() / ConnectAsync()
    ADB->>Lua: adb shell + root shell
    Lua-->>ADB: codex_map_dump.json / codex_player_status.json
    ADB-->>UI: MapDump + PlayerStatus
    UI->>Domain: 反序列化、探索状态规范化、快照/hash
    UI->>Planner: PlanFull / PlanExploration / PlanToPortal
    Planner-->>UI: route + interactions + target universe
    UI->>Exec: ExecuteDetailed(context, token)
    Exec->>ADB: TouchDown / ChangeDirection / Pulse / TouchUp
    loop 每个移动分段
        Exec->>ADB: ReadPlayer()
        ADB->>Lua: 读取人物状态 JSON
        Lua-->>ADB: 坐标/序列号/速度/迷雾
        ADB-->>Exec: PlayerStatus
    end
    par 独立弹窗监控
        Watch->>ADB: 截图 + UI Pipeline/OCR
        ADB-->>Watch: PopupKind
        Watch-->>UI: 取消当前分片并锁存弹窗
    and Pipeline 诊断
        UI->>Trace: trace event
        Trace-->>Trace: pipeline-traces/*.json
    end
    alt 弹窗或坐标复核失败
        UI->>Domain: 更新 MotionInterrupt / FloorState
        UI->>Planner: 从权威位置重新规划
    else 到达交互点
        UI->>ADB: 方向交互/点击/弹窗处理
        ADB->>Lua: 写命令文件或触摸输入
        Lua-->>UI: 下一帧地图状态
    end
